abstract: "A reusable analysis framework and writing style tool based on William Stanley Jevons' public methodology, including the Jevons Paradox, Marginal Utility Theory, Mathematical Economics, the Coal Question, and the Sunspot Theory of Business Cycles. Designed to assist in analyzing the paradoxical relationship between technological progress and resource consumption, the unintended consequences of efficiency improvements, and long-term resource constraints. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent William Stanley Jevons personally or his unpublished views."
